  "notes": [
    "-AR verb with an **accent change in the presente**: the weak **i** takes an accent mark (í) in all singular forms and ellos/ellas/ustedes to break the diphthong",
    "Nosotros/nosotras is the exception: *enfriamos* (no accent)",
    "All other tenses follow regular -AR patterns",
    "Past participle: *enfriado* (regular)",
    "Often used reflexively: *enfriarse* — *la relación se ha enfriado* (the relationship has cooled), *se me ha enfriado el café* (my coffee has gone cold)",
    "Related: *frío/a* (cold), *el frío* (the cold)"
  ],
